43BC 56               (campaign_maps.asm):00039                 rorb
43BD F10D33           (campaign_maps.asm):00040                 cmpb MAP_CACHED
43C0 2607             (campaign_maps.asm):00041                 bne campaign_row_miss
43C2 9640             (campaign_maps.asm):00042                 lda <campaign_stage
